  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy for Women Entrepreneurs (AWE) | SOPROVED Agroforestry Farm Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Passionate about agriculture, Mbene&apos;s goal is to contribute to the establishment of sustainable agricultural systems in Senegal. Because of demographic growth and climate change, we need to have agricultural systems more resilient and more productive...This scholarship will therefore allow me first to set up a 3.5 ha agroforestry farm in the Niayes area in order to offer to our customers quality vegetables and fruits free of chemical inputs. This farm will also be a space for exchange and training on agroforestry practices for the benefit of smallholders farmers in the Niayes area. Environmental training will be also offered to students from the villages near the farm.</narrative>
  </description>
